cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CA-TBL: Confidence-Aware Tier-Based Localization for GPS-Denied Search and Rescue (ns-3.47 simulation)"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A three-tier radio localisation simulation (868 MHz LoRa, 2.4 GHz LoRa time of flight, UWB) with a decision layer
  that escalates between tiers on a position-confidence score, a five-state inertial filter, per-action energy
  accounting, and the registered campaigns and regression gates used to evaluate it. Built on ns-3.47.
authors:
